Subject: [PATCH] J72 observer: leave storage initialization to Linux

Private RAM observer build only. Do not issue storage commands in the loader.
The firmware handoff remains available through the separate FDT preparation.
SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT

--- a/src/ans1.c
+++ b/src/ans1.c
@@ -372,5 +372,8 @@
 bool ans1_init(void)
 {
+    /* This observer always receives its kernel/initramfs from the host. */
+    printf("ANS1: loader storage disabled in J72 observer build\n");
+    return false;
     if (ans1_initialized) {
         printf("ANS1: already initialized\n");
         return false;
